/E (Thecomplete methodological approach used in this research to detect spoofing attacks onGlobal Navigation Satellite System \(GNSS\) signals using artificial intelligence and machine learning. The methodology is structured to ensure that the results can be replicated, that different models can be fairly compared, and that the approach can be applied effectively in real-world settings. It covers all the key stages, including data collection, preprocessing, feature engineering, model development, training strategies, and methods for evaluating performance. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
